## Contrato de repositorio

```dart
abstract class [FeatureRepository] {
  Future<Either<Failure, [ReturnType]>> [methodName]([params]);
}
```

## Estados del BLoC/Cubit

```dart
// States
class [Feature]Initial extends [Feature]State {}
class [Feature]Loading extends [Feature]State {}
class [Feature]Success extends [Feature]State {
  final [DataType] data;
}
class [Feature]Failure extends [Feature]State {
  final String message;
}
```

## Inyección de dependencias

Agregar en `lib/injection_container.dart`:
```dart
// [Feature] Use Cases
sl.registerLazySingleton(() => [FeatureUseCase](repository: sl()));
// [Feature] Repository
sl.registerLazySingleton<[FeatureRepository]>(() => [FeatureRepositoryImpl](dataSource: sl()));
// [Feature] BLoC
sl.registerFactory(() => [FeatureBloc](useCase: sl()));
```

